We then entered the following source code into the control that opened. It opens the callback method
of the sensor control in the Frame with the name PartDestination and the label Callback.
As we want to open the window of the Method, not to execute its source code, we have to enter the
reference operator & in front of the name of the sensor control.
self.~.~.&PartDestination.openDialog
