Play a Video in Your Simulation Model
To embed and play a video in a simulation model with the default media player, proceed as follows:
• Record the video in a video recording tool and save it as an .avi file.
We recorded a worker who places parts into a work cell and then removes the processed parts from it.
We named our video file MyVideo.
• Drag the video, i.e., the AVI file, from the Windows Explorer to the Frame. Click Yes in the dialog to
embed the video into the model.
• Our simulation model now looks like this.
